   "notes": [
    "After a cancel the WAV header and the 206 Content-Length still announce the whole track. When playback reaches the end of the decrypted audio, the client closes each Range request without data; Chromium logs ERR_CONTENT_LENGTH_MISMATCH, retries the Range request, and the element stays in 'waiting' (no 'ended'/'error'), so the UI keeps polling and posting playback forever."
   ],
